Description: Bump vendored cc crate to 1.0.85
 Bump vendored cc crate to 1.0.85 so that libc crate is not needed when
 building stage 1 std. This is important because libc requires core
 crate which conflicts with the bootstrapping std or core crate.
Author: Zixing Liu <zixing.liu@canonical.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2024-02-13
---
This patch header follows DEP-3: http://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/
